    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Configuration changes to the services",
      "description": "Every pair, timeframe, strategy, risk profile or promotion the control plane saved and then announced on the broker. published is the announcement landing; failed is a send that threw and skipped is one offered while the publisher was stopping, and both are swallowed behind a 2xx. market-data is the only consumer and also reconciles on the hour, so a lost event is an hour of stale subscriptions rather than a change that never happens. All three outcomes start at zero, so a flat zero is silence and not a missing series.",
